Usage: nvc [OPTION]... COMMAND [OPTION]...

Global options are placed before COMMAND, and command-specific options are placed afterwards. Multiple commands can be given and will be performed in order.

Commands:
 -a [OPTION]... FILE...       Analyse FILEs into work 
